      "file": "docs/ref/challenge_brief.md",
      "section": "1",
      "source": "Space Apps 2026 challenge page",
      "text": "Instead of a flickering teardrop, a candle flame becomes a ghostly blue sphere reliant on diffusion for its oxygen."
    },
